Third-party components
----------------------

The source repository contains no third-party code beyond the dependency
manifests and lock files. Builds and installers bundle third-party
components; every runtime dependency must be on the allowlist in
licenses/policy.toml, which records the licence and the reason for each
package. `npm run licenses` and `cargo deny check` (src-tauri/deny.toml)
enforce it, and the CI job `licenses` produces an SBOM for every build.

Model weights are not part of the repository. scripts/fetch-models.sh
downloads them at setup time with pinned revisions and SHA-256 checksums:

  tessdata_best (deu, eng), tag 4.1.0
    https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata_best
    Apache License 2.0

  granite-docling-258M, GGUF conversion by ggml-org
    https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/granite-docling-258M-GGUF
    Original model by IBM, Apache License 2.0

Distributions that ship these weights or the bundled libraries must carry
their licence texts and any NOTICE files they contain.
